import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 486 | Dragon Rune · Energy-Waste Analysis: Tiandao-Law Aptitude Used for Personal Sainthood","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 486 | Dragon Rune · Energy-Waste Analysis: Tiandao-Law Aptitude Used for Personal Sainthood","no":486,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Rune","Gu Chensha","Tiandao Law","Energy Waste"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","17-Plane-Transcendent Strongest Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0486_模块2-龙符-能级浪费解析-天道法资质用于个人成圣.md","filePath":"en/0486_模块2-龙符-能级浪费解析-天道法资质用于个人成圣.md"}'),a={name:"en/0486_模块2-龙符-能级浪费解析-天道法资质用于个人成圣.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,h,u){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-486-dragon-rune-·-energy-waste-analysis-tiandao-law-aptitude-used-for-personal-sainthood" tabindex="-1">Entry 486 | Dragon Rune · Energy-Waste Analysis: Tiandao-Law Aptitude Used for Personal Sainthood <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-486-dragon-rune-·-energy-waste-analysis-tiandao-law-aptitude-used-for-personal-sainthood" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 486 | Dragon Rune · Energy-Waste Analysis: Tiandao-Law Aptitude Used for Personal Sainthood&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Rune Decomposition (Entry 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 15, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-power-of-number-one-in-history-only-cultivated-himself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the power of number one in history, only cultivated himself <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-power-of-number-one-in-history-only-cultivated-himself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the power of number one in history, only cultivated himself&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — judgment on &quot;energy waste&quot;: if a power only cultivated one person, then no matter how big it is, it is waste. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Gu Chensha&#39;s Tiandao Law is precisely the extreme of this waste.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s energy direction has four layers of waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Cosmos-tier aptitude, personal-tier use</strong>: he can mend sky, reform heaven, create universes, but all these actions&#39; purpose is &quot;Gu Chensha himself becomes number one in history.&quot; Cosmos-tier energy compressed into one person&#39;s &quot;cultivation milestone&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Ranks zero spillover</strong>: the Tiandao Law he understood never transmitted to Myriad Ranks as public text. Myriad Ranks&#39; understanding of the Dao still stops at &quot;whatever Gu Chensha says&quot;</li><li><strong>Civilization zero infrastructure</strong>: the universes he created have no schools, no hospitals, no councils — he created &quot;space,&quot; did not create &quot;society&quot;</li><li><strong>Cross-generation zero inheritance</strong>: his ability travels with him alone; if he falls, all understanding goes with him</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a cosmos-tier understanding exists only in one person&#39;s brain, this understanding becomes his private property. Myriad Ranks can look up to him all they want, but only look up — <strong>looking up is not learning; reverence is not inheritance.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s predation is not greed for wealth, it is <strong>&quot;understanding right&quot; predation</strong>: Tiandao Law&#39;s true content, true path, true threshold, all defined by him alone. Myriad Ranks wanting to become dragons can only become in his way. This is the highest-level knowledge monopoly — <strong>turning the Great Dao itself into personal private property.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Gu Chensha Personal Sainthood</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tiandao Law in Gu Chensha&#39;s brain</td><td>300 Origin systems fully public</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad Ranks look up to him</td><td>Alaya Network; knowledge learnable, teachable</td></tr><tr><td>He creates universes no society</td><td>Anchor Council + Symbiotic Court</td></tr><tr><td>Ability travels with him alone</td><td>Myriad-Ranks origin bidirectional cycle</td></tr><tr><td>Number one in history</td><td>20% activation strategy; strong ones emerge in batches</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain injects variable &quot;Gu Chensha on the day he cultivates Tiandao Law, writes all understanding into public canon.&quot; Simulation shows: within a hundred years, among Myriad Ranks over a thousand strong ones reach Tiandao Law threshold; thousand strong ones co-build new universes; Gu Chensha himself from &quot;the sole pillar&quot; becomes &quot;one of thousand founders&quot; — <strong>once energy publicized, single log turns into forest.</strong></p><p>This simulation&#39;s key: Tiandao Law&#39;s understanding itself does not depreciate because of publicity. Quite the opposite, publicity lets more people participate in understanding, supplement understanding, correct understanding — the more people participate, the richer, deeper, more reliable understanding becomes. Gu Chensha alone understanding Tiandao Law is one understanding; ten thousand people together understanding Tiandao Law is ten thousand understandings plus mutual dialogue and verification. <strong>Knowledge is not like treasure; the more you divide, the less; knowledge is like fire; the more you spread, the brighter.</strong> Gu Chensha privately hoarding Tiandao Law equals cupping a pile of fire in one person&#39;s arms — he himself is warm, Myriad Ranks still cold.</p><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;understanding-right predation&quot; is more thorough than Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;knowledge monopoly.&quot; Tang Luo at least did not publicize mid-low martial arts; he at least publicized basic cultivation methods; Gu Chensha did not even publicize Tiandao Law&#39;s principles — he only let Myriad Ranks know &quot;he cultivated it,&quot; did not let Myriad Ranks know &quot;how to cultivate it.&quot; This &quot;result public, process private&quot; way is more dangerous than completely not publicizing: it lets Myriad Ranks know the road&#39;s endpoint exists, but does not let Myriad Ranks know where the road is. <strong>The most thorough monopoly is not letting people not see the endpoint, but letting them see the endpoint yet not see the road.</strong> Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s 300 Origin cultivation systems are precisely opposite — it not only tells you where the endpoint is, it also publicizes every step in Alaya Network.</p><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s Tiandao Law private hoarding also causes a more hidden consequence: Myriad Ranks lose confidence in &quot;cultivation&quot; itself. When Myriad Ranks see Gu Chensha cultivated Tiandao Law, but do not know how, they will conclude &quot;Tiandao Law only geniuses can cultivate.&quot; This conclusion once internalized, no one dares try again. <strong>The biggest harm of privately hoarding the Great Dao is not that Myriad Ranks cannot learn, but that Myriad Ranks dare not learn.</strong> Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s public system precisely wants to break this &quot;only geniuses can cultivate&quot; fear — everyone has a road, everyone dares try.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Tiandao Law boundary expands with Gu Chensha&#39;s personal promotion</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely high</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cosmos-tier understanding only cultivated one person</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Great Dao privatized as private property</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least publicized mid-low martial arts; Gu Chensha did not even publicize Tiandao Law principles</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks nominally all can become dragons, actually only look up</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: knowledge not publicized; cosmos not social</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tiandao Law is one of the peaks human imagination can reach. But Heng Yuan Zhou asks: <strong>if this peak belongs to only one person, for Myriad Ranks, what difference is there from not existing?</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.html">Entry 485 · Overview</a> · <a href="./489_模块2-龙符-天地众生皆可成龙批判-被成龙的恩赐制.html">Entry 489 · &quot;All Beings Can Become Dragons&quot; Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=n(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
